       <header class="app-hero rounded-2xl px-6 py-7 sm:px-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-aus">Billing reference</p><h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Billing &amp; Invoicing</h1><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6B7280]">Reference rules for discounts, payments, free services, and closing.</p></header>
